msgstr "Tipo de retorno"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.transform:1
msgid "Apply ``func`` to ``X``, forwarding any requested metadata keys."
msgstr "Aplica ``func`` a ``X`` y reenvía las claves de metadatos solicitadas."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.transform:3
msgid "Data to transform."
msgstr "Datos que se transformarán."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.transform:5
msgid ""
"Metadata values passed to ``func`` as keyword arguments. Only keys listed in "
"``self.metadata`` are forwarded."
msgstr ""
"Valores de metadatos que se pasan a ``func`` como argumentos de palabra "
"clave. Solo se reenvían las claves enumeradas en ``self.metadata``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.transform:9
msgid ""
"**X_transformed** -- Result returned by ``func(X, **kwargs)``. Output type "
"and shape are the responsibility of ``func`` and are not validated here."
msgstr ""
"**X_transformed** -- Resultado devuelto por ``func(X, **kwargs)``. El tipo y "
"la forma de la salida son responsabilidad de ``func`` y no se validan aquí."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.fit_transform:1
msgid "Fit and transform in a single step."
msgstr "Ajusta y transforma en un solo paso."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.fit_transform:3
msgid ""
"Overrides the default ``TransformerMixin.fit_transform`` to ensure that "
"``**metadata`` is forwarded to both ``fit`` and ``transform``."
msgstr ""
"Sobrescribe el método predeterminado ``TransformerMixin.fit_transform`` para "
"garantizar que ``**metadata`` se reenvíe tanto a ``fit`` como a "
"``transform``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.fit_transform:10
msgid "Keyword arguments forwarded to both ``fit`` and ``transform``."
msgstr ""
"Argumentos de palabra clave reenviados tanto a ``fit`` como a ``transform``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.fit_transform:13
msgid "**X_transformed** -- Result returned by ``func``."
msgstr "**X_transformed** -- Resultado devuelto por ``func``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.get_metadata_routing:1
msgid "Return the metadata routing configuration for this transformer."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve la configuración de enrutamiento de metadatos de este transformador."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.get_metadata_routing:3
msgid ""
"Registers each name in ``self.metadata`` as a requested parameter for both "
"``fit`` and ``transform``, enabling sklearn's metadata routing to propagate "
"them through a ``Pipeline``."
msgstr ""
"Registra cada nombre de ``self.metadata`` como parámetro solicitado tanto "
"para ``fit`` como para ``transform``, lo que permite que el enrutamiento de "
"metadatos de sklearn los propague a través de un ``Pipeline``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer.get_metadata_routing:7
msgid "**request** -- The populated routing object."
msgstr "**request** -- El objeto de enrutamiento configurado."
